  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "For point outside dielectric sphere <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ε</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></math> <br >For point inside dielectric sphere  <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow></msub><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> <br >Exact Ratio  <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mo>:</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mo>:</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mo>:</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn></math>",
